note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Contract section 4 line 90: break in an unrolled body is error 9 (line 9, the break). The same
note text without unroll (unroll-break-rolled.om) is accepted and exits 2.
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4 unroll
if eq i 2
break
end
s = add s 1
end
ret int s
end
